      "writtenOn": "2015-03-12T00:28:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If people feel we really do need this level of checking then I\u0027m ok to add it...although my gut feel is we may be over complicating it.  I also worried about having to do the reverse pattern match today of checkin whether %(*) exists in each whitelisted option - I guess that\u0027s safe, but wonder if it might accidentally match something innocuous.",
      "parentUuid": "9a80dd14_15122ab4",
      "revId": "5b2a2606c552dd77d0979aa40d006d60fa509eba",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
